  "[Click here to go to the boss puzzle](https://sudokupad.app/hfyjv8jqr5)": "[点击进入首领谜题](https://sudokupad.app/hfyjv8jqr5)",
  "A tall tower rises on the western edge of the land. Its gate is tightly shut and three keys are required to enter. Once you find the keys, enter them in the red cells. The topmost key goes in the topmost lock, and so on.": "大陆西缘耸立着一座高塔，大门紧闭，必须找到三把钥匙才能进入。找到钥匙后，将它们的数字填入红色格子：最上面的钥匙对应最上面的锁，以此类推。",
  "Adjacent digits along a green VINE must differ by at least 5. Any leaves or grass is purely cosmetic.": "绿色藤蔓线上相邻两个数字的差至少为 5。叶片和草丛只是装饰。",
  "All non-wall digits orthogonally adjacent to a drone cell have the same parity. Note that this only applies to adjacent cells and not the drone itself.": "与无人机格正交相邻的所有非墙壁格，数字必须具有相同奇偶性。注意：此规则只针对相邻格子，不包括无人机格自身。",
  "All orthogonally adjacent lava cells must differ by at least 2.\n\n(Note that pink or red cells are cosmetic and if they are surrounded by lava cells, they too count as lava. BREAKABLE cells do not count as lava.)": "正交相邻的熔岩格之间数字之差至少为 2。\n\n（粉色或红色格只是装饰；若四周被熔岩包围，也算作熔岩格。可破坏格不算熔岩。）",
  "All walls are Fillomino puzzles. They consist of orthogonally connected regions where all digits within a region equal the size of the region, and two regions of the same size may not touch each other orthogonally. Cells with a blue PHASE ENTRY POINT have the same value as the adjacent wall cell they phase into.": "所有墙壁都遵循 Fillomino 区域填数规则：墙壁格划分成若干正交连通区域，每个区域内的数字都等于该区域格数；相同大小的两个区域不能正交相邻。带蓝色“相位入口点”的格子与它穿入的相邻墙壁格数值相同。",
  "At the peak of the towering steel monstrosity is an antenna. You suspected as much after your time in the bunker -- this is the thing powering your drones, and Wark’s barrier technology. You’ve been unable to remotely disable the barriers, but perhaps you can gain some insight into their inner workings by examining the antenna from up close? Having explored everywhere else, it’s your last hope.": "在高耸的钢铁怪物顶端，你发现了一根天线。经历了地下掩体之后，你早就有所怀疑：这东西为无人机和沃克的屏障技术供能。你一直没能远程关闭屏障，或许靠近研究天线的运作方式能找到突破口？其余地方都已探索，这成了最后的希望。",
  "BALL CHUTES": "滑球槽",
  "Black WALL JUMP arrows have two components: the tip of the arrow, and the wall cell at its base. Move an equal number of cells as the value of the arrowhead's cell, starting in the arrowhead cell and moving in the direction of the arrow. The digit in the cell you land in will have the same value as the wall cell.\n\nFor example, if the arrowhead is 1 and the wall cell is 2, then there should be a 2 in the cell adjacent to the arrowhead (in the direction it points).\n\nThis rule is identical to how Shinespark worked in the previous puzzle.": "黑色“穿墙跳跃”箭头包含两个部分：箭头尖端，以及它根部的墙壁格。从箭头尖端格开始，沿箭头指示方向前进，移动的格数等于箭头尖端格的数字；落点格的数字必须与墙壁格相同。\n\n例如，若箭头尖端为 1、墙壁格为 2，则箭头方向上紧邻尖端的一格必须是 2。\n\n这与前作的“蓄力冲刺（Shinespark）”规则相同。",
  "BREAKABLE BLOCKS": "可破坏方块",
  "Breaking barriers": "突破屏障",
  "Bunker buster": "掩体破坏者",
  "Caldera chaos": "火山口混战",
  "Cells marked with an explosion are BREAKABLE. To put on enough pressure, they must be larger than all orthogonally adjacent cells, including walls(!) but excluding other breakable cells.": "标有爆炸符号的格子是可破坏格。要产生足够压力，它的数字必须大于所有正交相邻格（**包括墙壁格！**），但不必大于其他可破坏格。",
  "Climbing the weird tower from the outside proves trickier than navigating its insides. With no footholds in sight, you have to get creative, using a combination of wall jumps and drone platforms to ascend. As you approach the top of the tower, a monstrous metal-dragon passes above you. It lets out a deafening screech, as if inviting you to try conquering its domain.": "从外侧攀登怪异高塔比在内部穿行更加困难。没有落脚点，你只能灵活结合穿墙跳跃和无人机平台向上攀爬。接近塔顶时，一条巨大的机械龙从你头顶飞过，发出震耳欲聋的尖啸，仿佛是在邀请你挑战它的领地。",
  "CRYSTAL CAGES": "水晶笼",
  "Digits along HEAT VENTS must decrease as you go from the round bulb to the tip of the line.": "沿散热孔线条的数字，必须从圆形球部朝线条末端递减。",
  "Digits along the arrows sum to the value of the circle at the arrow's base. Arrows never overlap or share cells with other arrows.": "箭头上的数字之和等于箭头根部圆圈内的数字。不同箭头之间不会重叠，也不会共用格子。",
  "Digits an equal distance (along the line) from the middle of a BALL CHUTE sum to the middle digit. The lines are always of an odd length and the middle cell is always marked.": "沿滑球槽线条，距中间格距离相等的两格数字之和必须等于中间格的数字。线条总是奇数格长，中间格也一定有标记。",
  "Digits separated by a white SCAN DOT differ by exactly 1.": "白色扫描点两侧的数字恰好相差 1。",
  "Each row and column of orange CRYSTAL CAGES must sum to the same value. In most cases, the value is given in the top-left corner of the cage, but if there is a question mark in the corner, you have to figure out the sum yourself.": "橙色水晶笼中的每一行和每一列，其数字之和必须相同。多数情况下，这个和值写在笼子左上角；若左上角是问号，则需要自行推导和值。",
  "Each yellow wall RUNE corresponds to a unique digit. All instances of the same RUNE map to the same digit, while different runes map to different digits.": "每种黄色墙壁符文对应唯一数字。同一种符文始终代表相同数字，不同符文则代表不同数字。",
  "Entropic lines": "熵线",
  "Equal parities": "奇偶相同",
  "Equal sums": "等和",
  "EVENT: SEALED VAULT DOOR": "事件：封闭金库门",
  "EVENT: THE MIRACLE SEED": "事件：奇迹种子",
  "EVENT: X MARKS THE SPOT": "事件：X 标记的地点",
  "Eyes in the sky": "空中之眼",
  "FAULT LINES": "断层线",
  "For each ARROW clue, draw a line in the direction of the arrow, starting in the cell with the arrow's head and with length equal to the circled value at the arrow's base.\n\nDigits along the line have to be a set of consecutive digits in any order (without repeating digits).\n\nIf the line would hit a wall, it instead bounces by rotating 90 degrees away from the wall. Notably, it does so inside the cell itself, rather than moving to the cell's corner and bouncing there. It also doesn't cut corners and will bounce instead. The line is not allowed to go straight into a wall (or diagonally into an opposing corner). If it does, it has to be short enough to stop before hitting the wall.\n\nIf you want an example, look [here](https://sudokupad.app/7asln8p2u1)": "对每一个箭头线索，从箭头尖端格开始，沿箭头指示方向画一条线，线条长度（以格子计）等于根部圆圈里的数字。\n\n沿线数字必须组成一组连续整数，顺序不限，且数字不得重复。\n\n如果线条即将撞上墙壁，必须转向远离墙壁的一侧，旋转 90 度后继续延伸。注意，转向发生在当前格内，而不是先走到格子顶角再折返；线条也不能切过墙角，遇到墙角必须转向。线条不得直接走进墙壁，也不能沿对角方向撞上相对的墙角；若会撞墙，线条就必须短到刚好在撞上前结束。\n\n需要示例时，请看[这里](https://sudokupad.app/7asln8p2u1)。",
  "For each blue water cell, there must be at least ONE water cell among the eight surrounding cells that differs by exacly 1.\n\n(Note that pink or red cells are cosmetic and if they are surrounded by water cells, they too count as water. BREAKABLE cells do not count as water.)": "对每一个蓝色水域格，其周围八格中必须至少有**一个**水域格，数字与它恰好相差 1。\n\n（粉色或红色格仅是外观装饰；如果周围是水域格，它们同样算作水域格。可破坏格不算水域。）",
  "HEAT VENTS": "散热孔",
  "In order to break through BARRIER lines, each set of three digits along the lines must contain a low, middle and high digit (123, 456, and 789 respectively), in any order.": "要击穿“屏障线”，沿线任意连续三个数字都必须分别有一个低位数字（1、2、3）、一个中位数字（4、5、6）和一个高位数字（7、8、9），次序不限。",
  "In the corner": "角落之中",
  "In the rubble right next to where you woke up, you find a still intact power cell that used to belong to your suit. You slot it in and can’t help a sigh of relief as the now fully-powered nanobots start buzzing about, repairing and improving joints and platings. Soon, your suit shines orange, and that means it’s now immune to lava!": "在你醒来的地点旁边，一堆瓦砾中竟还藏着一枚完好的战甲能源电池。你将它装上，终于松了一口气：重获充足电力的纳米机器人开始嗡嗡工作，修理并强化关节与护甲板。没多久，战甲便闪耀起橙色光芒——如今你已能免疫熔岩！",
  "Inside the center of the geode is a seed. You can’t make any sense of it, so you bring it back to the refugee camp in the hope that someone there knows what to do with it.\n\nThey do, and it causes quite a stir. This mystical beanstalk seed grows to amazing heights when planted. With this, you can finally reach the uppermost layer of the planet again!\n\nStarting in the refugee camp in Sector 7 (the yellow circle), draw an 8 cell long VINE straight up. Digits along the VINE differ by at least 5.": "晶洞中央藏着一粒种子。你不明白它有什么用，便把它带回难民营，希望有人能认出来。\n\n果然，他们认识这东西，整个营地都轰动了。这颗神秘的魔豆种子一经种下便会长到惊人的高度。有了它，你终于能够重新抵达星球最上层！\n\n从第 7 区难民营的黄色圆圈出发，笔直向上画一条长度为 8 格的**藤蔓线**。沿线相邻数字之差至少为 5。",
  "Inverse thermometers": "反向温度计",
  "Large steel constructions tower over a dry lakebed. Pipes and chutes criss-cross up the sides and you spot multiple abandoned shacks, bolted haphazardly to the walls.": "巨型钢铁建筑群耸立在干涸湖床上。管道和滑槽在建筑外墙交错纵横，墙上还零乱地固定着许多废弃小屋。",
  "Metal riddle": "钢铁谜题",
  "Missiles aquired": "已获得导弹",
  "People celebrate! For once, you've managed to win without destroying the planet in the process. Wark's doomsday weapon is no more and his minions are surrendering in droves.\n\nThe people of the refugee camp thank you, their leaders already busy trying to fill the vacuum left by the madman's fall and peace is being restored across the planet. You join them for a feast, get your fair share of back pats, but before long you're back in the cockpit once again.\n\nYou're a drifter after all, and this puzzle is solved. Time to set out for new adventures, to worlds unseen!": "人们欢呼雀跃！这次你终于在没有摧毁整颗星球的情况下获胜。沃克的末日武器已被摧毁，他的手下纷纷投降。\n\n难民营的人们向你道谢，他们的领袖已经忙着填补暴君倒台后留下的权力真空，整个星球正逐渐重获和平。你与他们共享盛宴，接受众人的感谢和祝贺，但不久便再次坐进飞船驾驶舱。\n\n毕竟你是个浪迹星际的旅人，而这道谜题已经解开。该启程去往未知世界，展开新的冒险了！",
  "Phase suit": "相位战甲",
  "Power restored!": "电力恢复！",
  "Proof that you have fully filled in a Sector correctly!": "证明你已经正确填满了本区域的所有数独格！",
  "Proof that you have fully filled in the walls of a Sector correctly!": "证明你已经正确填满了本区域的所有墙壁格！",
  "Refugee camp": "难民营",
  "Refugee rescue": "营救难民",
  "Renban arrow lines": "连续数箭头线",
  "Rule breaking": "打破规则",
  "Rule making": "制定规则",
  "SCAN DOTS": "扫描点",
  "Sequence breaking": "突破序列",
  "Serpent cluster": "蛇群",
  "Slingshot arrows": "弹弓箭头",
  "Speed running": "极速通关",
  "Sudoku rules do not apply to purple wall cells, they may contain any of the digits 1-9, or no digits. Formally, the Sudoku constraint of the sector is satisfied if no row, column or box contains repeated digits, excluding all wall cells.\n\nDo note that if any other clue applies to a wall cell, the cell still needs to contain a digit that satisfies that clue.": "数独规则不适用于紫色墙壁格：它们可以填入 1 至 9 的任何数字，也可以留空。严格来说，只要忽略所有墙壁格后，区域各行、各列、各宫内均无重复数字，就满足该区域的数独约束。\n\n但请注意：如果其他线索涉及墙壁格，该格仍必须填写符合线索要求的数字。",
  "Sum arrows": "求和箭头",
  "SUPER MISSILES": "超级导弹",
  "TARGETING ARROWS": "瞄准箭头",
  "The antenna": "天线",
  "The barrier shatters and water comes flooding out, as a well-timed explosion tears through the weak spot in the concrete dam. You watch in wonder as the lakebed is once again filled with water. Color all non-wall cells in Sector 10 blue, up to the dashed line. They are now considered water cells and follow underwater rules.": "屏障破碎，洪水奔涌而出！恰到好处的一次爆炸炸穿混凝土水坝的薄弱点。你惊讶地看着干涸的湖床重新被水淹没。将第 10 区虚线以下的所有非墙壁格涂成蓝色。这些格子现在视为水域格，并遵循水下规则。",
  "The bunker": "地下掩体",
  "The geode": "晶洞",
  "The heat is intense as you step up onto the slopes of an active volcano and your ailing suit struggles to keep up. Smoke and steam billows out from heat vents in the ground. You feel the earth tremble slightly.": "你踏上活火山的山坡，炽热难耐，损坏的战甲难以承受。烟雾与水蒸气从地面的散热孔不断涌出，你感到大地微微颤动。",
  "The steel construct looms ever tall above you. You've climbed high, but it still stretches on, further than you can reach. Beyond a not too distant hill, you spot smoke. Whether it's trouble or relief remains to be seen. You've no doubt yet to see the last of Wark's minions.": "钢铁巨构仍高耸在你头顶。你已经攀得很高，但顶端依然遥不可及。不远处山丘后面升起了烟雾。那究竟意味着麻烦还是希望，目前还不清楚。但你知道，沃克的爪牙绝不会就此罢休。",
  "The tower": "高塔",
  "The tower is strange, seemingly made entirely from a single piece of some dark, unknown metal. There are no seams or joints in the surface, yet somehow you still manage to climb it, thanks to your newfound abilities.\n\nIn a room near the top you find sketches of several mysterious glyphs and RUNES. According to some hastily scribbled notes, someone once used this room to study them.": "这座塔十分古怪，仿佛完全由一整块未知的深色金属雕成，表面看不到任何接缝或连接处。所幸凭借刚获得的能力，你仍成功攀了上去。\n\n在靠近塔顶的房间内，你找到了几种神秘图腾和符文的草图。随手写下的笔记显示，曾有人在此研究它们。",
  "The volcano erupts! Draw a line from each of the two dots above the lava (row 5, column 5 and 6). The lines may move diagonally and may cut corners, but may not cross heat vents or wall cells. They also cannot cross or intersect with each other. The lines must cover all orange dots and behave like slow inverse thermometers (digits along the lines must decrease or stay the same as you move away from the volcano).": "火山爆发了！从熔岩上方的两个点（第 5 行、第 5 列与第 6 列）分别画一条线。线可以斜走、可以切角，但不得穿过散热孔或墙壁格，两条线也不能相交或彼此交叉。两条线必须覆盖所有橙色圆点，并像缓慢下降的反向温度计一样：从火山向外延伸时，沿线数字只能减小或保持不变。",
  "The wind howls as it sweeps across the jagged overhang that makes up this particular cliffside. You ride the current of hot air generated by the volcano. There is seismic activity going on here as well, and you're kept on your toes as you weave between lava plumes and billowing smoke.": "狂风呼啸，扫过构成崖壁的锯齿状突出岩层。你乘着火山生成的热上升气流前进。这里也有地震活动，穿梭于熔岩柱和滚滚浓烟之间，你必须时刻保持警惕。",
  "Thermal scans": "热成像扫描",
  "This is a list of hints in case you get stuck. Below is a list of objectives for each story moment, suggesting what to work towards.\n\n\n\n1. Defeat the boss in Sector 3.\n\n\n2. Exit Sector 14 via Sector 15 (don't worry about filling in all digits in the sector, it will be a long time before you can fully clear any sector.)\n\n\n3. Collect the upgrade in Sector 11.\n\n\n4. Find a way into Sector 12.\n\n\n5. Find a way into Sector 10.\n\n\n6. Collect one of the upgrades in Sector 10.\n\n\n7. Defeat the boss in Sector 12.\n\n\n8. Collect the upgrade in Sector 12.\n\n\n9. Find a way into Sector 6.\n\n\n10. Find a way into Sector 9.\n\n\n11. Find a way into Sector 5.\n\n\n12. Find a way into Sector 7.\n\n\n13. Defeat the boss in Sector 9, then find a way into Sector 8.\n\n\n14. Defeat the boss in Sector 7, then return to Sector 14.\n\n\n15. Find a way into Sector 16.\n\n\n16. Find a way into Sector 15 from Sector 16.\n\n\n17. Collect all keys and unlock the gate in Sector 5.\n\n\n18. Find a way into Sector 1.\n\n\n19. Defeat the boss in Sector 16, then keep filling in wall cells, collect runes and, ultimately, find a way to break the blocks in Sector 10.\n\n\n20. Collect the upgrade in Sector 10.\n\n\n21. Find another way into Sector 15.\n\n\n22. Collect the upgrade in Sector 15.\n\n\n23. Find a way into Sector 1.\n\n\n24. Defeat the boss in Sector 1.\n\n\n25. Find a way into Sector 13.\n\n\n26. Collect the upgrade in Sector 13.\n\n\n27. Find a way into Sector 3.\n\n\n28. Find a way into Sector 4.\n\n\n29. Find a way into Sector 2.\n\n\n30. Collect the upgrade in Sector 2.\n\n\n31. Defeat the boss in Sector 4.\n\n\n32. Fill in the rest of the grid.\n\n\n??. Defeat boss 0.\n\n\n??. Fill in the learnt rules grid.": "如果遇到卡关，可以参考这份按剧情进展编排的提示清单。下面列出了每个剧情节点的目标，帮助你判断下一步该做什么。\n\n1. 击败第 3 区的首领。\n\n2. 由第 14 区经第 15 区离开。（不必急着填满整个区域：距离彻底清除任一区域还早得很。）\n\n3. 取得第 11 区的升级道具。\n\n4. 设法进入第 12 区。\n\n5. 设法进入第 10 区。\n\n6. 取得第 10 区的一项升级。\n\n7. 击败第 12 区的首领。\n\n8. 取得第 12 区的升级道具。\n\n9. 设法进入第 6 区。\n\n10. 设法进入第 9 区。\n\n11. 设法进入第 5 区。\n\n12. 设法进入第 7 区。\n\n13. 击败第 9 区首领，然后设法进入第 8 区。\n\n14. 击败第 7 区首领，然后返回第 14 区。\n\n15. 设法进入第 16 区。\n\n16. 从第 16 区设法进入第 15 区。\n\n17. 收集全部钥匙并打开第 5 区大门。\n\n18. 设法进入第 1 区。\n\n19. 击败第 16 区首领，继续填写墙壁格，收集符文，最后设法打破第 10 区的方块。\n\n20. 取得第 10 区的升级道具。\n\n21. 另找一条进入第 15 区的路线。\n\n22. 取得第 15 区的升级道具。\n\n23. 设法进入第 1 区。\n\n24. 击败第 1 区首领。\n\n25. 设法进入第 13 区。\n\n26. 取得第 13 区的升级道具。\n\n27. 设法进入第 3 区。\n\n28. 设法进入第 4 区。\n\n29. 设法进入第 2 区。\n\n30. 取得第 2 区的升级道具。\n\n31. 击败第 4 区的首领。\n\n32. 填满棋盘其余格子。\n\n??. 击败第 0 号首领。\n\n??. 填满已习得规则的清单格。",
  "Under pressure": "压力之下",
  "Under significantly more pressure": "更巨大的压力",
  "Unfinished business": "未了之事",
  "Unwelcome welcome": "不受欢迎的欢迎",
  "Wall cells separated by a black FAULT LINE must have a 1:2 ratio (similar to black kropki dots).": "被黑色断层线隔开的两个墙壁格，数字必须成 1:2 的倍数关系（类似黑色克罗基点）。",
  "Wall glyphs": "墙壁符文",
  "WALL JUMPS": "穿墙跳跃",
  "WALL PHASING": "穿墙相位",
  "WHISPER VINES": "低语藤蔓",
  "You blast your way through a crack in the wall. On the other side is an underground bunker and research facility. You don't get much time to take in the sight as moments later, an emergency blast door shuts right in your face. You're not getting through this one any time soon so you leave it for now.": "你炸开墙壁上的一道裂缝。另一侧是一座地下掩体和研究设施。还没来得及仔细观察，紧急防爆门便砰地一声在你眼前关闭。短时间内看来没法通过，只能先离开。",
  "You come across another abandoned research station. This one was in decent condition before you flooded the place and a few machines still refuse to give in, despite the room being completely submerged. You recognize a DRG mining probe and manage to download a mapping of regional FAULT LINES to your suit.": "你发现另一座废弃研究站。这一座在被你淹没前状况还算不错；即使房间已完全泡在水里，几台机器仍顽强运转。你认出了一台 DRG 采矿探测器，并成功将附近地区的断层线地图下载到战甲上。",
  "You descend into the firey inferno that is the innards of the volcano. Visibility is absolutely rotten and you're sweltering inside your suit. Still, your scanner says there's a key to be had here, and by this point you have nothing else to go on when it comes to finding your way back home, so into the volcano we go!": "你下降到火山内部的烈焰地狱。能见度糟透了，战甲里更是闷热得难以忍受。可扫描仪坚称这里有一把钥匙；此时你已经没有其他返回家园的线索，只好硬着头皮钻进火山！",
  "You discover a research station. Geological surface scans show an intricate network of heat vents. You copy their thermal mappings indicating how to ride the updrafts from these “inverse thermometers” as the researchers seem to call them.": "你发现了一座研究站。地质地表扫描显示，地下分布着错综复杂的散热孔网络。你复制了热能分布图，研究人员似乎把利用这些上升气流的方式称作“反向温度计”。",
  "You don’t strike gold. Instead, you emerge inside a geode of tall, orange crystals. The brittle gemstones surround something in the center, but navigating the sharp edges is tricky. To retain their structural integrity, each row and column of a CRYSTAL CAGE must sum to the value in the top-left corner.": "没有挖到黄金，眼前却是一座布满高耸橙色水晶的晶洞。易碎宝石包围着中央的某样东西，但尖锐的晶体使你难以接近。为保持结构稳定，**水晶笼**内的每一行和每一列数字之和必须等于笼子左上角的数值。",
  "You emerge in a dry and dusty field and are greeted by a wave of hot air. Wrecks and debris from some long forgotten battle dot the landscape.": "你走进一片干燥、布满尘土的荒地，迎面扑来一股热浪。很久以前某场战争留下的残骸和废墟散落在四周。",
  "You emerge inside the underground bunker. Complex machinery relay data metrics back and forth from various points of interest around the planet. Despite the vicinity to an erupting volcano, the air is surprisingly cool.": "你进入地下掩体。复杂的机器不断在星球各个重要地点之间传递测量数据。虽然离正在喷发的火山很近，空气却出奇地凉爽。",
  "You feel the dampness through your suit as you emerge underwater in a large basin. The wreck of an old space ship lies at the bottom, but the large hole in the hull makes it clear it’s never going to fly again.": "你穿过战甲感到潮湿：原来自己来到了水下的大盆地。湖底躺着一艘古老飞船的残骸，可船壳上的巨大破洞表明它再也不可能起飞。",
  "You find people. Refugees, huddling in a small, makeshift camp. They greet you warmly, once they realize you’re not one of Wark’s goons. The warmongering alien is using the planet as a base for his conquest of the solar system, forcing its people to scavenge for the dangerous, old technology of their ancestors to use as advanced weapons.\n\nThe people in the camp are trying to escape their oppressors, but resources are running low. You promise to help, but reaching Wark’s fortress up on the cliffs above will be near impossible. The camp’s elders hand you a suit upgrade and suggest you explore the nearby water basin. It’s been untouched by scavengers due to the number of deadly predators living there and may still contain something of use. You steel yourself for what lies ahead.": "你终于遇到了人！一群难民蜷缩在简陋的小营地里。确认你不是沃克的走狗之后，他们热情地欢迎了你。这名好战的外星人以本星球为基地，企图征服整个恒星系，并强迫居民搜寻祖先遗留下的危险古代科技，将其改造成先进武器。\n\n难民们试图摆脱压迫，却已快耗尽物资。你答应提供帮助，但想抵达上方悬崖的沃克堡垒几乎不可能。营地长老交给你一项战甲升级，并建议探索附近的水盆地。那里栖息着众多致命掠食者，一直无人敢去搜寻，可能还藏着有用的东西。你鼓起勇气，准备迎接新的挑战。",
  "You hit the jackpot beating this guy! You access the memory banks of the wrecked dragon, revealing a map to buried treasure that Wark was no doubt trying to get his claws on.\n\nTo find the treasure cell within sector 13 (in the bottom left corner), draw a horizontal line from one of the keys and a vertical line from a second key. The value of third key goes into the cell where the two lines meet.": "打倒那家伙后，你简直中了大奖！你访问机械龙残骸的记忆库，发现了沃克显然一直想据为己有的埋藏宝藏地图。\n\n要在左下角的第 13 区找到藏宝格，从一把钥匙所在格画一条水平线，再从第二把钥匙画一条竖直线；两条线的交点填入第三把钥匙的数值。",
  "You land on Cell-81, the hidden homeworld of the ancient Puzzlo race. Your ship perches precariously atop the steep cliffs that make up the topmost layer of the planet. The foliage is dense up here, hiding your ship from view. Time to find out who broadcasted that emergency signal.": "你降落在 81 号格星球（Cell-81），古老谜族失落的故乡。飞船危险地停在星球最上层的陡峭悬崖上。这里植物茂密，飞船完全隐没在枝叶中。该弄清是谁发出了那条求救信号。",
  "You manage to salvage a half-decent MISSILE launcher from a large, crab-like exoskeleton. Despite the rust and mismatching interfaces, you quickly get the optical targeting system back in working condition.": "你成功从一副巨大的蟹形外骨骼装甲上拆下一具还算不错的**导弹发射器**。虽然有锈蚀和接口不匹配的问题，你仍很快修好了光学瞄准系统。",
  "You manage to sneak a peek at Wark’s base of operation. It’s a disheartening sight: the base is heavily fortified, and there are plenty of those barriers that almost broke you before. You will need an edge to deal with them before you stand any chance at defeating Wark and his army. (You just found Wark's base, but it might still be a long time before you're strong enough to confront him. Don't be alarmed if you have plenty of logs left to find.)": "你偷偷窥见了沃克的作战基地。景象令人沮丧：基地防守极严，还有大量先前差点要你命的屏障。想击败沃克及其军队，必须先找到突破这些屏障的优势。（你只是刚发现沃克的基地，可能还有很长一段时间才能强大到与他正面对决。如果还有许多剧情记录尚未找到，不必惊慌。）",
  "You step into a dimly lit chamber. On a pedestal, under a single, bright spotlight, lies a suit unlike any you’ve seen before, the light seemingly inverting as it bounces off the polished metal surface. This is the PHASE SUIT. Read the unlocked rules carefully!": "你踏入昏暗的房间。一束明亮聚光灯照在基座上的一套战甲上，那是你从未见过的款式。光芒从抛光金属表面反射时，仿佛连光暗都颠倒了。这里放着的正是**相位战甲**。请仔细阅读刚解锁的规则！",
  "You wake up at the bottom of a ravine. Faint daylight seeps down from cracks in the ceiling, illuminating your surroundings enough that you can navigate. Your suit is badly damaged and almost all of your equipment is broken or offline. Your scanner still works, as do your trusty gardening gloves, so you should be able to climb your way out.": "你在峡谷底部醒来。微弱日光从顶部裂隙照进来，勉强照亮足以辨认方向的环境。战甲损毁严重，几乎所有装备都已损坏或离线。幸运的是，扫描仪和你可靠的园艺手套还在运作，应该能爬出去。",
  "You walk up to the largest console and start mashing buttons at random, prompted by your suit’s AI. With some guesswork (and a conveniently placed sticky-note with all the important passwords), you manage to transfer access to the base’s remote controlled DRONES to you, allowing you to use them as platforms when exploring.": "你听从战甲人工智能的建议，走到最大的控制台前开始胡乱按键。靠着猜测和一张恰巧贴在那里的“重要密码大全”便利贴，你成功取得基地遥控**无人机**的控制权，可以把它们当作探索时的移动平台。",
  "You’re in luck! Among the fire and brimstone, the volcano has spit out an upgrade cache that must have fallen into the caldera long ago. Inside the cache lies a slightly singed MORPH BALL upgrade, complete with fire decals.": "真走运！在烈焰与硫磺之中，火山吐出了一只很久以前落入火山口的升级补给箱。箱内是一项边缘略有烧焦、还带火焰涂装的**变形球**升级。",
  "You’ve found it! There is a way to break through the barriers if you vary the frequency just right across the width of the fields. Armed with this insight, you’re unstoppable! You toggle your missile launcher to butt-kicking mode and march for the enemy stronghold. Time to end this!": "找到了！只要让屏障整个宽度上的频率以恰当方式变化，就能突破它。有了这个发现，你已经势不可挡！你将导弹发射器切换到“痛击敌人”模式，向敌军要塞进发。是时候结束这一切了！",
  "You've made a puzzle out of the rules table and even managed to solve it!": "你甚至把规则清单本身变成一道谜题，还成功解开了它！",
  "You've managed to actually solve a puzzle that should have been impossible!": "你竟真的解开了一道原本应该不可能完成的谜题！",
  "Your fault": "你的断层",
  "Your ship still stands where you left it. It seems that despite their boast, Wark's goons were either unable to get the ship to fly, or they were busy failing to chase you down. Either way, it's a relief to see the ship still in one piece.\n\nBut you can't leave just yet. You have unfinished business with Wark, and until they're dealt with there's no way you'll leave the refugees behind.": "你的飞船仍然停在原地。看来沃克的爪牙虽然夸下海口，却不是没本事让飞船起飞，就是忙着徒劳地追捕你。总之，看到飞船依旧完好无损，总算松了一口气。\n\n但还不能离开。你与沃克之间仍有未了之事，在解决他之前，你绝不能抛下难民不管。",
  "a surrounding water": "周围一个水域",
  "adjacent cells": "相邻格子",
