  "Digits adjacent": "正交相邻的数字",
  "Digits along a VINE": "藤蔓线上相邻数字",
  "Digits along BALL CHUTES": "滑球槽上的数字",
  "Digits may repeat here!": "这里的数字可以重复！",
  "Digits separated by a SCAN": "被扫描点隔开的数字",
  "dot differ by exactly 1": "两侧恰好相差 1",
  "Draw Renban lines": "画出连续数线",
  "Each wall RUNE": "每个墙壁符文",
  "equals adjacent wall.": "等于相邻墙壁格",
